WEBVTT

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:21.114
One hundred and thirty two years.

00:01:21.139 --> 00:01:23.225
Destiny had been waiting...

00:01:23.225 --> 00:01:24.768
For this to happen.

00:01:24.893 --> 00:01:30.732
Our love will be rewritten on the
day of the fourth chance.

00:01:30.899 --> 00:01:33.443
Shae needs to know
that I'm having fun too

00:01:33.443 --> 00:01:35.529
and my weekend's not boring.

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:40.992
Guys!

00:01:41.422 --> 00:01:42.423
Sorry.

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:43.544
Were you hurt?

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:43.544
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:01:44.175 --> 00:01:46.510
Shae... James confessed to me.

00:01:46.535 --> 00:01:47.536
He said I'm the one he likes.

00:01:47.582 --> 00:01:49.155
I only have James.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:50.556
So, don't take him away.

00:01:51.174 --> 00:01:54.260
James... I already told you
to stop bugging me.

00:01:54.285 --> 00:01:55.185
Hey...

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:57.630
- No, please go.
- Come on. Let's go.

00:01:58.343 --> 00:01:59.343
Hey!

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:00.886
Ouch!

00:02:06.072 --> 00:02:07.811
This is not your diary.

00:02:07.811 --> 00:02:10.480
And it will never be yours.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:11.280
Huh?!

00:02:11.314 --> 00:02:11.832
How did you--

00:02:11.857 --> 00:02:13.191
You were just there moments ago.

00:05:04.905 --> 00:05:06.323
We should hurry!

00:05:09.284 --> 00:05:10.702
What happened to you?

00:05:12.704 --> 00:05:14.122
Are you hurt?

00:05:15.971 --> 00:05:17.598
Why is your nose bleeding?

00:05:18.768 --> 00:05:20.395
This is a prank, right?

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.631
My schoolmates are making fun of me again.

00:05:22.656 --> 00:05:25.024
Tell them this is getting too old now.

00:05:26.176 --> 00:05:27.761
Don't fool me or else...

00:05:29.246 --> 00:05:31.454
And where did you learn that language?

00:05:33.509 --> 00:05:34.639
Forgive her.

00:05:34.993 --> 00:05:38.163
She might be tired from studying last night

00:05:38.188 --> 00:05:40.190
- That's why she's acting strange.
- She called me Carmelita?

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:44.069
My ancestor? Oh no, is this a
side effect from the sleeping pills?

00:05:44.069 --> 00:05:47.572
Helena, Nenita, Natasha... You go ahead.

00:05:47.614 --> 00:05:50.575
I will take her to the
convent to get some rest.

00:05:51.952 --> 00:05:52.994
Wait... Hold on!

00:05:53.453 --> 00:05:54.657
Carmelita!

00:05:55.163 --> 00:05:56.206
Come back here!

00:05:56.231 --> 00:05:57.231
Wait!

00:06:02.355 --> 00:06:04.899
So, I went back to the time of Carmelita?

00:06:08.642 --> 00:06:10.435
I-- I think I'm gonna die!

00:06:18.353 --> 00:06:20.230
Okay. I'm dead.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.272
Miss?

00:06:35.861 --> 00:06:36.861
Dad?

00:06:37.298 --> 00:06:38.298
Carmelita?

00:06:39.275 --> 00:06:40.651
How are you feeling?

00:06:42.017 --> 00:06:44.060
Gosh. I'm still here?

00:06:44.085 --> 00:06:45.712
I am not dreaming?

00:06:45.737 --> 00:06:48.031
This is real. This is so real.

00:06:49.342 --> 00:06:51.386
I've sent a letter to Mother and Father.

00:06:51.386 --> 00:06:53.263
I'm sure you'll be able
to come home safely.

00:06:53.763 --> 00:06:54.763
What?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.062
We're sisters?

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:57.761
Ofcourse!

00:06:58.012 --> 00:07:00.014
What are you talking about, Carmelita?

00:07:00.039 --> 00:07:02.124
It is I, your sister Josefina.

00:07:02.149 --> 00:07:06.821
Josefina? The one Grandma Carmina talked
about. Carmelita's sister who became a nun.

00:07:07.169 --> 00:07:12.216
My gosh. I need to go back home.
How can I return home?

00:07:14.159 --> 00:07:16.386
Where am I? What is this place?!

00:07:16.411 --> 00:07:19.539
I cannot understand you. We're
here at Colegio de Santa Isabel!

00:07:19.539 --> 00:07:21.958
You have to bring me back
to the place where you found me!

00:07:21.958 --> 00:07:23.293
I want to go back home!

00:07:23.318 --> 00:07:24.757
What is happening to you?

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:26.671
Carmelita!

00:07:26.671 --> 00:07:27.564
Carmelita!

00:07:27.589 --> 00:07:28.314
Carmelita!

00:07:28.339 --> 00:07:29.549
Please, help me!

00:07:29.549 --> 00:07:31.586
I don't care how high this is, I will jump!

00:07:31.885 --> 00:07:33.219
Please, help me!

00:07:33.244 --> 00:07:34.061
Carmelita!

00:07:34.095 --> 00:07:36.556
- Carmelita, will you lie down?!
- I want to go home! Daddy!

00:07:36.556 --> 00:07:39.445
- What's wrong with you?
- Daddy! Daddy, help me! No!

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:42.156
What is happening to you?
You are not making any sense!

00:07:42.289 --> 00:07:44.064
Please! I need to get out of here!

00:07:44.064 --> 00:07:45.406
Carmelita, calm down.

00:07:49.903 --> 00:07:51.154
How dare you?!

00:07:52.146 --> 00:07:54.231
Demon, begone from our sister's body!

00:07:54.908 --> 00:07:56.676
Natasha, what are you doing?

00:07:56.701 --> 00:07:58.787
Your sister is being possessed, Josefina!

00:07:59.162 --> 00:08:01.206
- I'm not possessed...
- She's speaking another language.

00:08:01.206 --> 00:08:03.625
Can't you hear what she's saying?

00:08:03.833 --> 00:08:06.586
She doesn't recognize you
and she's saying she's not Carmelita.

00:08:07.143 --> 00:08:10.272
I bid you, demon.
Leave our sister's body! Help me out here!

00:08:10.828 --> 00:08:12.133
Let us pray!

00:08:12.133 --> 00:08:14.928
Hail Mary, full of grace.
The Lord is with you.

00:08:14.953 --> 00:08:17.080
Blessed are you--

00:08:18.473 --> 00:08:19.766
Let her go.

00:08:22.591 --> 00:08:23.884
Mother Olivia!

00:08:24.687 --> 00:08:25.980
You...

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.568
You...

00:08:30.819 --> 00:08:32.112
It's you...

00:08:33.113 --> 00:08:34.484
It's you!

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:42.056
What's wrong with all of you?!

00:08:42.831 --> 00:08:44.415
Leave us alone.

00:09:12.278 --> 00:09:14.114
Can you please explain to me?

00:09:15.113 --> 00:09:16.698
First, you stole my diary.

00:09:17.729 --> 00:09:19.968
Second, you took me into this place.

00:09:21.184 --> 00:09:23.478
And now, they're thinking
that I am possessed.

00:09:32.589 --> 00:09:34.507
I want to go home.

00:09:36.843 --> 00:09:38.761
I want to go home!

00:09:39.637 --> 00:09:41.556
I want to go home!

00:09:46.978 --> 00:09:48.021
First and foremost...

00:09:49.268 --> 00:09:51.145
I didn't stole the diary.

00:09:52.366 --> 00:09:54.534
I am going to return it to its true owner.

00:09:58.281 --> 00:09:59.699
Second...

00:10:01.065 --> 00:10:02.691
I was not the one who brought you here.

00:10:03.703 --> 00:10:04.954
And third...

00:10:06.581 --> 00:10:08.166
You are the reason

00:10:08.708 --> 00:10:12.295
Why they assumed
you are being possessed by a demon.

00:10:13.713 --> 00:10:16.049
Okay...
Fine.

00:10:16.966 --> 00:10:17.926
Whatever.

00:10:21.346 --> 00:10:22.889
But I want to go home now.

00:10:24.349 --> 00:10:25.892
How can I go back?

00:10:27.314 --> 00:10:29.650
There is no other way
back to your own time...

00:10:31.483 --> 00:10:33.860
Unless you finish your mission here.

00:10:35.568 --> 00:10:36.580
Mission?

00:10:37.872 --> 00:10:39.499
What mission?

00:10:41.019 --> 00:10:43.021
You have to stop destiny.

00:10:45.703 --> 00:10:48.790
You have to change what was written there.

00:10:57.131 --> 00:10:59.717
You and Juanito may never be together.

00:11:02.238 --> 00:11:05.616
You have to stop him
from falling in love with you.

00:11:06.557 --> 00:11:09.936
You cannot fall in love
with him in order to...

00:11:15.575 --> 00:11:18.269
Save him from being murdered
on the day of your wedding.

00:11:19.765 --> 00:11:24.246
She drowned herself in the lake.

00:11:28.454 --> 00:11:29.706
Annoying!

00:11:29.706 --> 00:11:34.127
She killed herself because of a broken
heart and now I'm tangled up in their mess?

00:11:36.087 --> 00:11:37.422
What if I refuse?

00:11:37.714 --> 00:11:40.049
What if I just admit to them that

00:11:40.049 --> 00:11:43.261
I am not Carmelita?
That I'm from the future.

00:11:43.872 --> 00:11:44.872
Alright...

00:11:46.306 --> 00:11:47.557
It's up to you.

00:11:47.557 --> 00:11:49.420
Let us see if they will believe you.

00:11:52.605 --> 00:11:54.566
There can only be two possibilities.

00:11:57.681 --> 00:11:58.693
First...

00:12:00.846 --> 00:12:06.602
They may believe that
you are being possessed.

00:12:07.744 --> 00:12:08.786
Or maybe...

00:12:09.537 --> 00:12:12.560
They may believe you have lost your mind.

00:12:15.918 --> 00:12:19.420
They may take you to all sorts of healers.

00:12:21.668 --> 00:12:23.818
Until they leave you for
good in a far off island.

00:12:25.636 --> 00:12:27.597
Why is there no good choice?

00:12:28.264 --> 00:12:29.498
The moment that happens...

00:12:31.142 --> 00:12:33.436
You will lose the chance
to go back to your time.

00:12:35.813 --> 00:12:36.904
Hold on to this.

00:12:38.456 --> 00:12:39.999
You are now it's rightful owner.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:53.873
In nomine Patris, et Fili,
et Spiritus Sancti. Amen.

00:13:09.651 --> 00:13:12.779
I prayed for Carmelita to the Virgin Mary.

00:13:13.361 --> 00:13:16.030
I hope she'll get better soon.

00:13:17.068 --> 00:13:18.092
That's right.

00:13:18.543 --> 00:13:21.087
Whatever is happening to Carmelita now...

00:13:21.619 --> 00:13:23.803
I'm sure she'll get passed it.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:28.334
Thank you, Helena, Nenita.

00:13:28.937 --> 00:13:32.178
I'm glad Carmelita has friends like you.

00:13:35.224 --> 00:13:39.019
Let us hurry. It is time to prepare dinner.

00:14:11.924 --> 00:14:13.718
More things were written here before.

00:14:14.287 --> 00:14:15.496
Where are they?

00:14:16.706 --> 00:14:18.916
For now, nothing is written there.

00:14:20.644 --> 00:14:25.533
We are in the time of June 1891.

00:14:26.132 --> 00:14:27.132
What?

00:14:30.895 --> 00:14:32.438
We're just in June right now?

00:14:34.098 --> 00:14:38.102
But Juanito died on February 29, right?...

00:14:40.271 --> 00:14:44.400
It means I have to stay for seven months
in order to finish my mission?

00:14:45.318 --> 00:14:46.819
That's too long.

00:14:48.905 --> 00:14:50.907
You and Juanito cannot meet each other yet.

00:14:51.407 --> 00:14:52.407
But...

00:14:52.575 --> 00:14:53.576
He has already laid his eyes upon you.

00:14:55.578 --> 00:14:58.517
He saw me... But I didn't see him?

00:14:59.086 --> 00:15:00.181
What do you mean?

00:15:02.131 --> 00:15:03.985
He saved you earlier this morning.

00:15:05.671 --> 00:15:06.839
When do I meet him?

00:15:07.026 --> 00:15:08.528
He's heading here right now.

00:15:08.966 --> 00:15:11.063
What?! As is now?! Now already?!

00:15:16.474 --> 00:15:20.645
Mother Olivia. Mr. Juanito
Alfonso is waiting downstairs.

00:15:21.145 --> 00:15:22.899
He wants to check on Miss Carmelita.

00:15:26.317 --> 00:15:28.027
Tell him to come back another day.

00:15:28.778 --> 00:15:31.242
Carmelita is not feeling
well at the moment.

00:15:35.159 --> 00:15:36.159
What?

00:15:36.661 --> 00:15:37.844
But I'm feeling fine.

00:15:38.162 --> 00:15:40.456
I want to see Juanito. We need to talk.

00:15:41.165 --> 00:15:42.208
It cannot be.

00:15:43.182 --> 00:15:45.944
You still need to explain
yourself to the women

00:15:45.969 --> 00:15:48.730
who saw you. Tell them
you are not possessed.

00:15:50.925 --> 00:15:51.925
Go to sleep.

00:15:52.253 --> 00:15:55.781
Think hard about your mission.

00:16:01.125 --> 00:16:03.043
Where have you been, Nenita?

00:16:03.771 --> 00:16:06.055
Have you forgotten about your chores?

00:16:07.024 --> 00:16:10.069
I just opened the door for
the gentleman who visited.

00:16:10.782 --> 00:16:15.412
You know it is not allowed to accept
guests in the convent at this late hour.

00:16:16.046 --> 00:16:17.477
Poor Juanito.

00:16:18.766 --> 00:16:20.143
Did you say Juanito?

00:16:21.715 --> 00:16:24.500
It seems like he's worried about
Carmelita. That's why he came.

00:16:27.435 --> 00:16:30.229
He might just wanted to check on her.

00:16:32.922 --> 00:16:34.250
If that's the case,

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:38.764
then I hope he can give us an answer
as to why my sister is acting strangely.

00:16:40.641 --> 00:16:41.851
May the Lord bless him.

00:16:53.738 --> 00:16:55.645
Will I really be staying here?

00:16:57.293 --> 00:16:58.377
No electricity.

00:16:59.118 --> 00:17:00.418
No cellphone.

00:17:02.413 --> 00:17:05.441
No internet! No wi-fi!

00:17:07.367 --> 00:17:09.161
I can't stay here!

00:17:10.004 --> 00:17:12.423
I need to find a way to escape from here.

00:17:16.677 --> 00:17:18.718
So, I just need to
keep Juanito from falling

00:17:18.742 --> 00:17:20.640
in love with me to
stop him from dying?

00:17:21.577 --> 00:17:27.291
That's easy. Why don't I just talk
to him directly so I can warn him?

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:40.463
I just wanted to check how
she's doing, Mother Olivia.

00:17:41.088 --> 00:17:43.287
She might have other symptoms
from what happened earlier.

00:17:44.213 --> 00:17:47.917
That's Juanito? The man I need to save?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.352
I can't see his face,
but... he has nice body.

00:17:49.377 --> 00:17:50.229
Don't you worry...

00:17:51.099 --> 00:17:56.135
Señor Hidalgo gave me permission since
this is part of my studies in medicine.

00:17:57.176 --> 00:17:59.213
Thank you for your concern, Juanito.

00:18:00.179 --> 00:18:01.639
But I have to disappoint you.

00:18:01.931 --> 00:18:03.948
Carmelita decided to rest early.

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:06.894
I'll go ahead. Please be on your way.

00:18:18.045 --> 00:18:19.045
Sampaguita!

00:18:19.229 --> 00:18:20.229
Sampaguita!

00:18:23.559 --> 00:18:24.559
Sampaguita!

00:18:28.034 --> 00:18:29.854
Oh God, please get away, dog!

00:18:30.044 --> 00:18:32.487
Don't be loud! The thief may fall down!

00:18:32.545 --> 00:18:34.838
Me? A thief?

00:18:41.837 --> 00:18:48.399
Hi, it's me. Carmela who became
Carmelita Montecarlos of 1891.

00:18:48.424 --> 00:18:53.431
Locking eyes with the man who
shattered her heart into pieces.

00:18:53.456 --> 00:18:58.946
And broke her will to live after
her beloved was murdered.

00:18:59.943 --> 00:19:04.949
Are you sure Carmelita will
be just fine, Mother Olivia?

00:19:08.414 --> 00:19:11.026
Please excuse my worrying heart.

00:19:11.846 --> 00:19:14.641
She is very precious to
our Mother and Father.

00:19:16.312 --> 00:19:18.480
She's the youngest of our family.

00:19:19.717 --> 00:19:21.963
Carmelita is a quiet and reserved lady.

00:19:24.138 --> 00:19:27.252
If given the chance, they wouldn't
want to be parted away from her.

00:19:28.934 --> 00:19:33.647
But she was allowed to study here
in Manila because I am here with her.

00:19:36.984 --> 00:19:39.195
I don't want to disappoint my parents.

00:19:42.656 --> 00:19:44.667
She'll get back to how
she was before, Josefina.

00:19:46.832 --> 00:19:47.833
I'll look after her.

00:19:52.374 --> 00:19:53.684
Do not worry, Miss.

00:19:53.709 --> 00:19:55.174
I'll catch you if you fall.

00:19:56.216 --> 00:20:01.649
I don't believe in love at first
sight. I don't believe in forever either.

00:20:01.674 --> 00:20:06.197
I don't even believe in
happy endings. But now...

00:20:06.222 --> 00:20:09.831
Why do I feel like I want
to get shot by Cupid?

00:20:12.785 --> 00:20:14.036
Miss!

00:20:19.527 --> 00:20:20.452
Ouch!

00:20:20.477 --> 00:20:21.477
Miss!

00:20:22.404 --> 00:20:23.846
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:20:24.226 --> 00:20:25.352
Isn't it obvious?

00:20:26.909 --> 00:20:28.854
What are you doing up there?

00:20:28.937 --> 00:20:32.899
I'm a thief just like what
you said earlier, remember?

00:20:35.636 --> 00:20:38.690
I thought men in this era were gentlemen.

00:20:39.672 --> 00:20:41.823
Do you really have no
intention of helping me?

00:20:43.133 --> 00:20:46.971
But, Miss, I can't be just careless
with my actions and touch you.

00:20:47.034 --> 00:20:51.851
Ah, right. People were more
conservative back in the old days.

00:21:02.606 --> 00:21:03.713
Who's out there?

00:21:05.229 --> 00:21:06.338
Come quick!

00:21:06.363 --> 00:21:07.065
Who are you?

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:09.245
Let's go! Carry me.

00:21:18.419 --> 00:21:19.419
Who's out there?

00:21:20.504 --> 00:21:22.409
Take me there! Carry me, quickly!

00:21:22.434 --> 00:21:24.463
Quick! You have to carry me!

00:21:25.843 --> 00:21:27.152
There! Over there!

00:21:27.177 --> 00:21:28.823
- Juanito, quickly!
- Alright, alright!

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.074
We almost got caught.

00:21:46.929 --> 00:21:48.263
Wait, Miss...

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.924
How did you know my name?

00:21:53.497 --> 00:21:54.497
Juanito.

00:21:54.873 --> 00:21:56.580
Listen carefully to what I'm about to say.

00:21:58.865 --> 00:22:00.987
This man's a snob.

00:22:02.338 --> 00:22:04.006
Okay, fine. Fine.

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:10.120
One of the nuns told me that you were here.
She spoke your name.

00:22:10.776 --> 00:22:13.190
That's how I knew.
But that's not important.

00:22:15.994 --> 00:22:17.073
Juanito...

00:22:18.103 --> 00:22:19.956
Whatever happens...

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.588
Don't you dare fall in love with me.

00:22:26.028 --> 00:22:27.495
In love?

00:22:28.739 --> 00:22:32.838
Right. People here aren't
used to speaking English yet.

00:22:33.118 --> 00:22:34.760
What I meant was...

00:22:36.205 --> 00:22:38.846
You must not give your heart to me.

00:22:44.856 --> 00:22:45.856
Why...

00:22:46.044 --> 00:22:47.315
Why are you laughing?

00:22:49.134 --> 00:22:52.054
Miss... please don't take it the wrong way.

00:22:52.846 --> 00:22:55.099
But the truth is, my heart
already belongs to someone else.

00:22:55.847 --> 00:22:59.267
What?! I got rejected?!

00:23:00.938 --> 00:23:02.557
Is there anyone there?

00:23:02.582 --> 00:23:04.292
Who's out there?

00:23:06.457 --> 00:23:07.625
Sampaguita!

00:23:08.663 --> 00:23:09.663
Sampaguita!

00:23:10.364 --> 00:23:11.364
Who's out there?

00:23:15.744 --> 00:23:16.815
Sampaguita!

00:23:17.746 --> 00:23:18.746
Sampaguita!

00:23:19.456 --> 00:23:20.456
Juanito, dear.

00:23:20.749 --> 00:23:22.584
- Mother Olivia.
- What are you still doing here?

00:23:22.918 --> 00:23:25.237
I'm just looking for my dog, Sampaguita.

00:23:26.672 --> 00:23:27.672
Sampaguita!

00:23:28.465 --> 00:23:29.465
Sampaguita!

00:23:29.842 --> 00:23:31.885
Sampaguita! Sampaguita!

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.221
Where did you go?

00:23:34.805 --> 00:23:37.599
You must be on your
way, dear. It's getting late.

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:39.143
Yes, Mother Olivia.

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:41.161
Thank you.

00:23:41.186 --> 00:23:42.354
Come now, Sampaguita.

00:24:07.337 --> 00:24:10.382
Always keep this in mind.

00:24:11.425 --> 00:24:14.540
Alright. Until our next class.

00:24:23.439 --> 00:24:25.316
- Umm...
- Juanito.

00:24:26.190 --> 00:24:27.816
How was your excursion last night?

00:24:28.442 --> 00:24:30.321
Did you examine the injured lady?

00:24:30.834 --> 00:24:33.540
There was no dizziness or confusion.

00:24:34.406 --> 00:24:38.642
Nor slowness in her responses or lethargy.

00:24:39.036 --> 00:24:40.621
The lady is in good health.

00:24:41.600 --> 00:24:42.935
Good.

00:24:43.957 --> 00:24:47.461
I believe you'll become an
exceptional doctor, Juanito.

00:24:49.713 --> 00:24:51.634
I'd like to ask permission, Doctor.

00:24:52.091 --> 00:24:54.540
To be excused from
our class for a few days.

00:24:55.385 --> 00:24:57.471
My Father and Mother are
asking me to come home.

00:24:58.806 --> 00:24:59.806
No problem.

00:25:00.349 --> 00:25:02.267
Are you coming back to San Alfonso?

00:25:03.018 --> 00:25:04.018
Yes.

00:25:04.728 --> 00:25:06.271
Gracias, Señor.

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:38.470
Carmelita, take a bath and get dressed.

00:25:44.309 --> 00:25:45.644
Where are we going?

00:25:45.644 --> 00:25:47.646
We're going home to San Alfonso.

00:25:51.213 --> 00:25:55.509
Don't worry. I won't
tell them what you did.

00:25:56.373 --> 00:25:59.126
I was the only one who saw
you and Juanito last night.

00:26:00.676 --> 00:26:03.762
I thought you were never
going to forget Leandro.

00:26:03.787 --> 00:26:06.874
Wasn't he the reason you
wanted to come here with me?

00:26:08.282 --> 00:26:09.794
Leandro?

00:26:10.752 --> 00:26:12.296
What a funny thing, love.

00:26:12.959 --> 00:26:16.592
One can never be sure when
it will fall into someone new.

00:26:18.760 --> 00:26:19.760
Are you ready?

00:26:20.971 --> 00:26:23.021
Our chauffeur is alreay here.

00:26:24.099 --> 00:26:25.146
You're coming with us?

00:26:27.311 --> 00:26:31.889
I won't allow you to mess up
what is destined to happened

00:26:32.594 --> 00:26:35.006
That is why I'm coming
to keep an eye on you.

00:26:42.859 --> 00:26:44.068
I can do it.

00:26:44.603 --> 00:26:46.480
I'm a strong, independent woman.

00:26:55.379 --> 00:26:59.509
I'm sure he'll keep his distance from
me since I was too aggressive last night.

00:26:59.962 --> 00:27:03.049
But that's good so he'll never be
linked to Carmelita now.

00:27:10.420 --> 00:27:15.525
It seems like you're writing
all your woes in that diary.

00:27:17.782 --> 00:27:19.451
You shouldn't have done that.

00:27:20.906 --> 00:27:22.157
What did I do wrong?

00:27:23.509 --> 00:27:25.803
You shouldn't have met with him last night.

00:27:27.334 --> 00:27:30.748
How did Mother Olivia
knew that I met Juanito?

00:27:31.166 --> 00:27:33.201
You cannot hide anything from me, Carmela.

00:27:43.804 --> 00:27:46.682
Why did you push me into
the Arc of the Centuries?

00:27:46.682 --> 00:27:49.142
It was painful and I tripped as well.

00:27:49.893 --> 00:27:53.214
Dear, you must learn how
to be polite with your words.

00:27:54.523 --> 00:27:58.800
Being respectful and having good manners
are important in this time period.

00:28:00.404 --> 00:28:03.740
Of course. But why did you push me?

00:28:05.450 --> 00:28:08.620
You still shouldn't have
met Juanito last night.

00:28:09.454 --> 00:28:13.083
Expect that a lot of things that are
supposed to happen will now change.

00:28:13.750 --> 00:28:18.422
And because of what you did,
your mission has become more difficult.

00:28:20.090 --> 00:28:21.591
Yes, Mother Olivia.

00:28:39.878 --> 00:28:43.256
It's been days since I
time slipped into this era.

00:28:49.901 --> 00:28:51.277
Get ready. They're already here.

00:28:51.302 --> 00:28:53.596
Is Mother Olivia a magician?

00:28:53.766 --> 00:28:55.852
She's so good at appearing out of nowhere.

00:28:58.918 --> 00:29:02.352
- Carmelita!
- Maria!

00:29:05.979 --> 00:29:09.477
- Madre Olivia.
- How are you?

00:29:09.542 --> 00:29:13.242
Madre Olivia, did my
sisters give you trouble?

00:29:15.431 --> 00:29:17.767
I didn't have any problems with Josefina.

00:29:18.294 --> 00:29:21.375
She's diligent in her studies
and is an obedient lady.

00:29:22.949 --> 00:29:24.586
Carmelita on the other hand...

00:29:27.666 --> 00:29:30.377
Is kind and is also obedient.

00:29:31.677 --> 00:29:37.933
Carmelita's reputation is good.
Oh God, I hope I don't ruin it.

00:29:38.159 --> 00:29:41.871
My great great great grandmother
is standing right in front of me!

00:29:42.236 --> 00:29:48.157
She's so beautiful! Flawless skin and soft
eyes. In short, she's prettier than me.

00:29:52.067 --> 00:29:55.987
Carmelita, aren't you glad
to see your eldest sister?

00:30:02.392 --> 00:30:05.687
It's been six months since I last saw you.

00:30:06.003 --> 00:30:08.422
I'm glad you're back home.

00:30:08.883 --> 00:30:10.325
She's so sweet!

00:30:10.325 --> 00:30:13.161
It made me remember Jenny and Emily.

00:30:13.161 --> 00:30:16.992
I wonder if they're looking for me?
Are they worried about me?

00:30:19.858 --> 00:30:21.776
Where are Mother and Father, by the way?

00:30:22.421 --> 00:30:24.756
They're preparing for the festival.

00:30:24.756 --> 00:30:26.657
Father has a lot of visitors today.

00:30:27.092 --> 00:30:29.428
They're waiting for us at the house.

00:30:30.308 --> 00:30:32.936
Come now. The carriage is waiting.

00:30:33.765 --> 00:30:35.142
Maria...

00:30:35.142 --> 00:30:38.937
I'd like to take Carmelita with me.
There's something we've got to go first.

00:30:42.138 --> 00:30:43.473
Is that so?

00:30:45.437 --> 00:30:47.439
Josefina and I will run along then.

00:30:47.464 --> 00:30:48.590
Good idea.

00:30:50.049 --> 00:30:52.051
I will have Eduardo escort you.

00:30:59.853 --> 00:31:03.023
My butt hurts from seating
too long in the carriage.

00:31:05.127 --> 00:31:07.880
That is why we rest before moving on.

00:31:09.298 --> 00:31:11.008
Be careful, dear.

00:31:12.512 --> 00:31:13.805
Carmela, dear.

00:31:14.566 --> 00:31:18.987
Don't forget that you are
Carmelita while you are here.

00:31:19.271 --> 00:31:24.234
Yeah, it's fine, Mother. Don't worry...

00:31:24.259 --> 00:31:26.845
Our names sound the exactly the same, so...

00:31:26.870 --> 00:31:28.372
I can handle it.

00:31:29.015 --> 00:31:30.032
Dear,..

00:31:31.435 --> 00:31:33.369
fix the way you talk.

00:31:33.796 --> 00:31:36.507
People in this time
period don't talk that way.

00:31:38.128 --> 00:31:39.505
Aside from that,

00:31:40.123 --> 00:31:41.666
mind your actions. Don't
be unrefined or rowdy.

00:31:41.691 --> 00:31:43.360
mind your actions. Don't
be unrefined or rowdy.

00:31:47.523 --> 00:31:49.192
Maybe I shouldn't move at all?

00:31:50.931 --> 00:31:51.962
You know, dear.

00:31:53.386 --> 00:31:54.596
During this time...

00:31:55.422 --> 00:31:56.840
Women are...

00:31:57.523 --> 00:31:58.941
very conservative.

00:31:59.908 --> 00:32:01.868
They do not hold hands.

00:32:03.891 --> 00:32:08.979
And they do not look into the eyes of men
who aren't their partners.

00:32:10.900 --> 00:32:12.610
Remember that.

00:32:14.837 --> 00:32:16.034
- Eduardo.
- Yes?

00:32:16.034 --> 00:32:19.037
Return to our carriage
and keep an eye on our belongings.

00:32:19.913 --> 00:32:20.915
Thank you.

00:32:22.749 --> 00:32:26.044
Dear. All that your eyes can reach

00:32:26.265 --> 00:32:29.059
is owned by the Montecarlos family.

00:32:29.506 --> 00:32:30.298
Wow!

00:32:30.298 --> 00:32:32.467
Happy festivities, Mother Olivia.

00:32:32.926 --> 00:32:34.759
Happy festivities to you as well, Raul.

00:32:34.884 --> 00:32:35.968
Where are you headed?

00:32:36.054 --> 00:32:39.099
To the preparations for
the Thanksgiving Feast.

00:32:39.987 --> 00:32:42.239
- Good. Take care, Raul.
- You as well.

00:32:45.326 --> 00:32:46.329
Dear,

00:32:47.030 --> 00:32:49.241
he is the father of Eduardo.

00:32:49.442 --> 00:32:52.987
He's been serving the Hacienda
Montecarlos for a long time.

00:32:54.152 --> 00:32:56.488
Your crops are the main products

00:32:56.700 --> 00:33:00.036
sold by San Alfonso to Manila.

00:33:01.530 --> 00:33:06.410
That is why your family is
one of the riches in this town.

00:33:06.435 --> 00:33:08.353
Wow...

00:33:35.365 --> 00:33:37.284
That is the Lake of Tears

00:33:38.400 --> 00:33:40.527
that is connected to the Wailing River.

00:33:40.768 --> 00:33:41.777
Lake?...

00:33:43.918 --> 00:33:47.794
Wait... Lake of Tears? Isn't that the...

00:33:49.145 --> 00:33:51.939
That is indeed the lake
where Carmelita drowned herself.

00:33:53.909 --> 00:33:55.911
The real Carmelita.

00:33:57.507 --> 00:33:59.926
Gosh! Someone died there!

00:33:59.951 --> 00:34:01.619
I'm losing it!

00:34:17.590 --> 00:34:20.968
Mother Olivia, Miss.
We need to go now.

00:34:21.438 --> 00:34:22.699
Alright.

00:34:36.312 --> 00:34:39.569
OMG! This is the same as
Grandma Carmina's house!

00:34:39.594 --> 00:34:45.207
But bigger, newer, and more elegant!
Seems only yesterday that I've been here.

00:34:47.276 --> 00:34:48.558
Remember.

00:34:49.040 --> 00:34:52.378
They must not suspect
that you are not Carmelita.

00:35:08.159 --> 00:35:10.144
Our most beloved youngest daughter.

00:35:14.242 --> 00:35:18.433
Carmelita. Thank goodness
you came back safe and sound.

00:35:19.714 --> 00:35:21.465
- Come on.
- Let's head inside.

00:35:22.363 --> 00:35:23.614
This way.

00:35:25.710 --> 00:35:27.574
- You look like you enjoyed your travels.
- How was your trip?

00:35:36.418 --> 00:35:39.160
My god! What will I do now?

00:35:39.583 --> 00:35:42.916
So they're Carmelita's parent's then.

00:35:42.941 --> 00:35:46.327
Don Alejandro, and Doña
Soledad Montecarlos.

00:36:01.881 --> 00:36:03.257
Please take some rest.

00:36:03.282 --> 00:36:07.412
We're heading to
the Alfonsos for dinner.

00:36:18.568 --> 00:36:21.824
Mother Olivia, aren't we
going to eat? I'm so hungry.

00:36:21.849 --> 00:36:23.100
The mass earlier was too long

00:36:23.125 --> 00:36:26.420
and I can't even understand a thing
since it's in Latin and Spanish!

00:36:28.787 --> 00:36:29.787
Dear,

00:36:30.236 --> 00:36:32.738
learn how to speak
respectfully to your elders.

00:36:34.084 --> 00:36:39.222
You will be scolded by anyone if
they hear you speak like that.

00:36:43.301 --> 00:36:45.470
- Amigo!
- Don Mariano!

00:36:45.470 --> 00:36:47.263
We were a bit early.

00:36:48.890 --> 00:36:50.433
I don't intend to keep you waiting,

00:36:50.433 --> 00:36:53.269
but our dinner will be served shortly.

00:36:53.269 --> 00:36:56.147
He is the Governor of San Alfonso.

00:36:57.273 --> 00:37:01.528
And beside him is his wife,
Doña Juanita.

00:37:01.861 --> 00:37:05.073
And his right hand man,
Captain Corpuz.

00:37:07.408 --> 00:37:10.370
Now, I'm delighted to introduce
you to my children.

00:37:10.370 --> 00:37:13.206
Who bring us both joy and pride.

00:37:16.376 --> 00:37:17.919
- This is Sergio.
- Sergio.

00:37:18.211 --> 00:37:19.963
- This is Angelito.
- Angelito.

00:37:19.963 --> 00:37:20.963
And of course...

00:37:21.381 --> 00:37:22.381
Juanito!

00:37:22.932 --> 00:37:24.049
My god!

00:37:24.050 --> 00:37:25.050
Juanito?

00:37:25.075 --> 00:37:26.075
Juanito?!

00:37:35.854 --> 00:37:36.854
Juanito.

00:38:22.328 --> 00:38:23.454
Thank you, mother.

00:38:23.692 --> 00:38:24.735
Eat up.

00:38:29.370 --> 00:38:30.383
My gosh.

00:38:30.408 --> 00:38:33.995
I forgot that he was the Governor's son.

00:38:34.221 --> 00:38:35.931
I shouldn't have come here.

00:38:36.331 --> 00:38:38.833
I'm remembering all the silly things I did!

00:38:44.439 --> 00:38:45.439
Miss!

00:38:47.224 --> 00:38:48.224
Juanito.

00:39:33.471 --> 00:39:34.389
- What's wrong?
- What happened?

00:39:34.389 --> 00:39:37.200
- Something's under the table!
- What? What's happening?

00:39:37.225 --> 00:39:38.225
Wait.

00:39:40.765 --> 00:39:41.933
What's happening?

00:39:42.375 --> 00:39:43.375
Sampaguita!

00:39:45.623 --> 00:39:46.833
Were you bitten?

00:39:46.858 --> 00:39:47.859
- What happened to you?
- Juanito!

00:39:47.884 --> 00:39:49.169
- I'm fine.
- Juanito!

00:39:57.124 --> 00:40:00.419
Dear, are you sure you're alright?

00:40:01.295 --> 00:40:02.588
Yes, Don Marino...

00:40:03.251 --> 00:40:05.503
I mean, Don Mariano.

00:40:06.045 --> 00:40:07.046
I'm fine now.

00:40:09.757 --> 00:40:10.608
Doña Juanita,

00:40:10.633 --> 00:40:13.219
Don Mariano, I apologize but

00:40:13.539 --> 00:40:16.292
it seems like
Carmelita was unharmed.

00:40:17.390 --> 00:40:20.143
Good. What's important is that
Carmelita was not hurt.

00:40:20.518 --> 00:40:23.104
If that's the case, then
let's continue with our dinner.

00:40:23.104 --> 00:40:24.414
- Sit down, everyone.
- Very well.

00:40:24.439 --> 00:40:25.440
Take your seats.

00:41:01.287 --> 00:41:04.646
Seems like you enjoyed the food
that was served to us.

00:41:05.730 --> 00:41:06.730
It was good.

00:41:06.755 --> 00:41:08.840
Miss, this is for you.

00:41:25.053 --> 00:41:26.053
What's that?

00:41:28.961 --> 00:41:30.088
Just like before,

00:41:31.255 --> 00:41:35.426
if Father or Mother asks,
you know nothing.

00:41:36.565 --> 00:41:40.736
Remember. I covered
up for you and Leandro too.

00:41:42.029 --> 00:41:44.865
Again? Who's that Leandro anyway?

00:41:47.355 --> 00:41:48.481
I'm heading out.

00:41:49.107 --> 00:41:52.372
If Father asks, I'm in the bathroom.

00:42:01.949 --> 00:42:03.075
My beloved,

00:42:03.325 --> 00:42:05.828
I am now here at our meeting place.

00:42:06.082 --> 00:42:10.086
Under the mango tree that
has been a witness to our love.

00:42:10.086 --> 00:42:15.466
I am waiting to see your beauty
that is unmatched in this world,

00:42:15.466 --> 00:42:16.759
now and forever.

00:42:17.343 --> 00:42:20.263
Beauty that is
unmatched in this world?

00:42:20.263 --> 00:42:21.163
Why?

00:42:21.188 --> 00:42:23.065
Have you seen the whole world?

00:42:24.267 --> 00:42:27.186
The one who wrote this
is such a sweet talker.

00:42:32.887 --> 00:42:35.331
Why do we need to worry about rebels?

00:42:35.489 --> 00:42:36.489
Amigo...

00:42:38.114 --> 00:42:41.325
As the Gobernadorcillo,

00:42:41.504 --> 00:42:47.426
I'm doing the best I can to listen
to every citizen's voice.

00:42:48.040 --> 00:42:52.628
I want to make sure to hear all
their worries and needs.

00:42:52.653 --> 00:42:58.856
That is why San Alfonso is very fortunate
to have you as our Gobernadorcillo

00:42:58.910 --> 00:43:00.814
Right you are, Captain Corpuz.

00:43:01.387 --> 00:43:05.474
I saw his care for the people
during our time together at school.

00:43:08.227 --> 00:43:09.687
My family...

00:43:10.605 --> 00:43:12.732
founded San Alfonso.

00:43:13.316 --> 00:43:15.693
That's why this town
is very important to me.

00:43:16.402 --> 00:43:18.196
Your dedication is inspiring.

00:43:18.696 --> 00:43:20.364
As you are, Alejandro.

00:43:21.824 --> 00:43:24.410
Your family business has
indeed grew more profitable.

00:43:24.676 --> 00:43:26.636
And you have helped so many people.

00:43:29.373 --> 00:43:32.585
You know the hardships
my family faced, Mariano.

00:43:33.586 --> 00:43:34.795
I've told you that.

00:43:35.652 --> 00:43:40.532
I do not want my family's effort
to be wasted nor our name to be tarnished.

00:43:42.747 --> 00:43:44.124
That is why I want

00:43:44.837 --> 00:43:49.591
my daughters to marry
into respectable families.

00:43:51.241 --> 00:43:52.241
Cheers.

00:44:25.429 --> 00:44:27.348
We're fine there at the convent.

00:44:28.108 --> 00:44:30.027
All right, I'll go ahead.

00:44:30.052 --> 00:44:31.387
They look so happy.

00:44:31.638 --> 00:44:34.808
My family is also like this
when we get-together.

00:45:11.246 --> 00:45:12.747
How are they doing now?

00:45:13.350 --> 00:45:15.936
I'm sure they're worried sick about me.

00:45:33.414 --> 00:45:34.582
Carmelita.

00:45:35.958 --> 00:45:37.126
Where is Maria?

00:45:39.349 --> 00:45:40.517
The thing is...

00:45:42.798 --> 00:45:44.300
Is he with Eduardo?!

00:45:44.717 --> 00:45:46.218
She met with Eduardo?!

00:45:47.845 --> 00:45:51.057
Our servant? He's the one
writing to Maria?

00:45:51.057 --> 00:45:53.642
Hush your voice or
someone might hear you!

00:45:53.775 --> 00:45:56.110
Oh! For real?

00:45:57.792 --> 00:46:00.962
Listen to me.
We're about to go home.

00:46:02.026 --> 00:46:06.572
Find Maria and tell her to come back
before Father looks for her.

00:46:07.281 --> 00:46:08.991
I will buy you some time.

00:46:09.887 --> 00:46:11.369
Why don't we just
tell them the truth?

00:46:11.369 --> 00:46:12.495
They'll bound to find out anyway.

00:46:12.495 --> 00:46:15.706
That cannot be.
Father might kill Eduardo!

00:46:16.553 --> 00:46:19.764
You know that Eduardo
came from a poor family.

00:46:19.789 --> 00:46:22.959
Father will never approve
of their relationship.

00:46:24.530 --> 00:46:27.700
Go on. Look for her
before anything bad happens.

00:46:29.345 --> 00:46:30.345
Alright.

00:46:39.358 --> 00:46:42.361
- Where will I look for her?
- Miss?

00:46:43.371 --> 00:46:44.371
Miss!

00:46:45.498 --> 00:46:46.833
Where do you think you're going?

00:46:47.831 --> 00:46:49.652
His tummy really stands out!

00:46:49.967 --> 00:46:52.308
if only there were
probiotics around this time.

00:46:54.412 --> 00:46:55.847
I just want some fresh air.

00:46:55.967 --> 00:46:56.967
Right.

00:46:57.917 --> 00:46:58.917
You may not.

00:46:59.542 --> 00:47:00.242
What?

00:47:00.251 --> 00:47:01.368
You may not do so.

00:47:01.836 --> 00:47:03.504
Even if I'm with her?

00:47:06.257 --> 00:47:10.678
Dear Diary, what the hell
is he doing here again?

00:47:10.761 --> 00:47:13.139
Why do we keep crossing each other's paths?

00:47:13.383 --> 00:47:16.594
Is he doing this or is it destiny?

00:47:19.092 --> 00:47:20.969
I cannot allow this to continue.

00:47:21.188 --> 00:47:23.566
I have to stay away from him, or else,

00:47:23.566 --> 00:47:25.776
I won't be able to go back to my own time.

00:47:26.485 --> 00:47:27.385
Losing my mind,

00:47:27.445 --> 00:47:28.696
Carmela.

00:47:29.022 --> 00:47:30.052
Miss.

00:47:32.032 --> 00:47:33.617
Where’s the mango
tree around here?

00:47:33.642 --> 00:47:34.977
Are we leaving?

00:47:35.536 --> 00:47:36.903
Where is your brother?

00:47:37.451 --> 00:47:38.911
Where is Carmelita?

00:47:39.373 --> 00:47:40.666
You know the saying,

00:47:40.921 --> 00:47:44.758
that when something
truly shameful happens,

00:47:45.850 --> 00:47:49.020
it’s better to just think
as if nothing happened.

00:47:49.045 --> 00:47:50.535
Does it mean something else?

00:47:50.560 --> 00:47:52.597
Your secret meetings
with Carmelita?

00:47:53.804 --> 00:47:54.805
Carmelita!

00:47:54.930 --> 00:47:55.930
Carmelita!

00:47:55.931 --> 00:47:56.431
Young lady.

00:47:56.432 --> 00:47:59.059
You’re going to be late
for the early mass in town.

00:48:00.060 --> 00:48:01.136
Is this a joke?

00:48:01.161 --> 00:48:03.914
They say she was caught last night
with the youngest of the Montecarlos.

00:48:04.088 --> 00:48:06.886
What is this rumor that
you are meeting another?

00:48:07.276 --> 00:48:11.947
Juanito, I believe that you have
no relation with Miss Carmelita.

00:48:11.972 --> 00:48:14.892
She wants you to clear
her daughter’s name.

00:48:15.117 --> 00:48:18.621
My friend, I would like to propose
that the wedding be held

00:48:18.621 --> 00:48:20.789
at the end of February
for the young ones.

00:48:20.789 --> 00:48:23.125
What do you say,
Miss Carmelita?

00:48:23.292 --> 00:48:24.668
What is it, Doña Juanita?

00:48:24.790 --> 00:48:26.746
How many children
do you wish to bear?